 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Keys and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data as
+`apiKeys` (see `docs/DATA.md`).
+
+- `viewer` may only read (GET).
+- `cook` may also cook recipes, record waste, log temperatures and enter
+  stock-take counts.
+- `manager` may do everything, and is the only role that may read `GET /audit`.
+
+A missing or unknown key is `401 unauthorized`; a known key without
+permission is `403 forbidden`. Every authenticated request that is not a GET
+adds an audit entry (time, key name, method, path, status).
